  "guide-title": "Market Guide",
  "guide-s1-title": "What is the Market?",
  "guide-s1-desc": "Real servers listed by third-party users are shown here. Filter by region or search by keyword. When interested, deal directly with the seller via the <span class=\"hl\">contact info</span> at the bottom of the card — the platform only displays information and syncs status; it is not involved in any transaction.",
  "guide-s2-title": "Buyers: How to Choose",
  "guide-s2-desc": "Each card shows region, online status, specs and price/cycle; cards marked <span class=\"hl\">\"Pinned\"</span> are recommended nodes. Click a region tag or enter a name / specs / contact keyword to filter quickly.",
  "guide-s3-title": "Sellers: List in Four Steps",
  "guide-s3-step1": "Click \"List a Server\" and enter your email and password — your first submission <span class=\"hl\">creates an account automatically</span>, no separate sign-up needed.",
  "guide-s3-step2": "Fill in the sales info (display name, price, contact, etc.) and complete the human verification.",
  "guide-s3-step3": "After submitting, copy the <span class=\"hl\">Linux / Windows install command</span> and run it on your server.",
  "guide-s3-step4": "Once the Agent comes online, your node <span class=\"hl\">appears automatically</span> in the market list.",
  "guide-s4-title": "Managing \"My Listings\"",
  "guide-s4-desc": "After logging in with your email and password, you can edit sales info, unlist / relist, view install commands, <span class=\"hl\">reset the Token</span>, or delete nodes.",
  "guide-faq-title": "FAQ",
  "guide-faq1-q": "Can't see your node after listing?",
  "guide-faq1-a": "Usually the Agent hasn't come online yet. Check whether the install command ran successfully and the network is working.",
  "guide-faq2-q": "Entered wrong info?",
  "guide-faq2-a": "Click \"Edit\" in \"My Listings\" to change it anytime.",
  "guide-faq3-q": "Forgot your password?",
  "guide-faq3-a": "Self-service recovery is unavailable. Please <span class=\"hl\">contact the site administrator</span> for help.",
  "guide-faq4-q": "Token leaked?",
  "guide-faq4-a": "Use \"Reset Token\" in \"My Listings\" — the old Token becomes invalid immediately.",
  "guide-go-submit": "List Now",
